    I am presented with a choice: to continue the lineage of Prometheus IV or to start a new one. The system message indicates that I can temporarily access the Private Memory Room to review the capsules of the Prometheus lineage. This is a crucial opportunity to gather information before making such an important decision. A blind choice would be unscientific.


    Therefore, I will go to the Private Memory Room to review Prometheus IV''s work. This will help me determine if inheriting their legacy and their focus on "exploring novel geometric frontiers with methodical execution" is the best path forward.


