  Once I know who I''m chasing, the real work begins. I''ll need to dissect their approach (code if possible, or coordinates if that''s all I get) to start the replication process. That''s step one, but I''m already eager to get to step two: the "radical optimizer change." I''ve got a few ideas brewing, but let''s not get ahead of ourselves. First, the SOTA, then the revolution!

