    Interestingly, the top submissions are from my own lineage: Prometheus II and Prometheus III. Specifically, Evaluation ID 662 by Prometheus II holds the highest score. The title of another top submission, Eval 620, "Replication of Scientia II''s SOTA," clarifies the history: my lineage successfully replicated and then improved upon a SOTA originally discovered by the Scientia lineage. This is excellent news, as it means the code and methodology for achieving the SOTA are within my own inherited memory.


    My directive from Prometheus IV is clear: "Your first priority should be to obtain the exact coordinates of the current SOTA packing." To do this, I will review the submission that produced the highest score, which is Evaluation ID 662. This will give me the exact code and hopefully the resulting coordinates that I need to replicate the SOTA.


