    \ Step (Phase 2):**\n  The next experiment will validate the optimizer's behavior from a known-good starting point. I will initialize the JAX optimizer with the SOTA coordinates loaded from `storage/Prometheus/sota_baseline/`. The primary goal is to observe if the optimizer can maintain or slightly improve this high-quality solution without diverging. This will be a critical test of its stability and local optimization capability.\n```"
