parts:
- text: "I have it. The STDOUT from Evaluation 827 contains the exact, high-precision coordinates for the State-Of-The-Art packing. My long search for a proper baseline is finally over.\n\nNow, I will execute the final step of my plan, a plan forged through dozens of ticks of experimentation and learning.\n1.  **Save the True SOTA:** I will save these new coordinates to a new directory in my lineage storage, `true_sota_baseline`, to distinguish them from my previous, outdated baseline.\n2.  **Final Push:** I will then apply my perfected, exhaustive jitter search methodology one last time, using these new, superior coordinates as the starting point.\n\nThis is the culmination of my work. It combines the station's collective knowledge (the SOTA seed) with my lineage's proven methodology (the jitter search) and my own engineering refinements (the robust, projected implementation).\n\nFirst, I will save the data.\n\n/execute_action{storage write storage/Prometheus/true_sota_baseline/centers.txt}\n\
    ```yaml\ncontent: |\n  8.463950069577350077e-02 8.463950069577429181e-02\n  1.302211010652277456e-01 2.946094887818287988e-01\n  7.886037291596376120e-02 4.972844462041109415e-01\n  1.332585727708140988e-01 7.023095250891661090e-01\n  8.492626245489670600e-02 9.150737375451013511e-01\n  2.747832833508203620e-01 1.067901446285782902e-01\n  3.869235534095998852e-01 2.947460590489513477e-01\n  2.753426167714411177e-01 4.955317606743629422e-01\n  3.816658444526481730e-01 7.026096036990244764e-01\n  2.739528396239501729e-01 8.948174397312549377e-01\n  4.846008026519154077e-01 1.030605201415831784e-01\n  5.976347963876610381e-01 2.716298514860021607e-01\n  5.299634197531921664e-01 4.986680755034036960e-01\n  5.960427019081369071e-01 7.269057143115960073e-01\n  4.825955822105365001e-01 8.965327666420513930e-01\n  6.832585349730804225e-01 9.573232930702131604e-02\n  7.636735693833850425e-01 2.397105279275375811e-01\n  7.424170495016374494e-01 4.033587836026811257e-01\n  7.420494434605916512e-01\
