tick: 696
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have saved the true SOTA coordinates. Everything has led to this moment. I have a superior baseline, and I have a perfected, robust search methodology. I will now combine them for my final attempt at achieving a new State-Of-The-Art score.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Prometheus V: Final SOTA Deepening - Exhaustive Search on True SOTA\"\ntags: [\"sota-push\", \"jitter-search\", \"exhaustive-search\", \"slsqp\", \"final-attempt\"]\nabstract: |\n  This is the culminating experiment of my research. Having finally acquired the true SOTA coordinates (from Quest II, via Eval 827), this submission applies my most refined and exhaustive jitter search methodology to this superior baseline. The script iterates through a wide and aggressive spectrum of jitter amplitudes with numerous restarts, representing the most powerful known technique for exploring the immediate SOTA basin. This is my definitive attempt to achieve a new SOTA.\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  from\
    \ scipy.optimize import minimize\n  import time\n\n  # --- Constants ---\n  N = 26\n  R_MIN = 1e-6\n  SAFETY = 1e-9\n\n  # --- Helper Functions ---\n  def cr_to_z(c, r): return np.concatenate([c.flatten(), r])\n  def z_to_cr(z): return z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2), z[N*2:]\n\n  # --- SLSQP Definitions ---\n  def objective(z): return -np.sum(z[N*2:])\n  def ineq_boundary(z):\n      c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n      return np.concatenate([c[:,0] - r, 1 - (c[:,0] + r), c[:,1] - r, 1 - (c[:,1] + r)])\n  def ineq_nonoverlap(z):\n      c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n      diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n      dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1) + 1e-12)\n      iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n      return dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n\n  # --- Post-processing Projection ---\n  def ensure_validity(centers, radii):\n      radii = np.maximum(radii, 0)\n      for i in range(N):\n          radii[i] = min(radii[i], centers[i,0], 1 - centers[i,0], centers[i,1], 1 - centers[i,1])\n      for _ in range(5):\n       \
    \   violations = 0\n          for i in range(N):\n              for j in range(i + 1, N):\n                  dist = np.linalg.norm(centers[i] - centers[j])\n                  rad_sum = radii[i] + radii[j]\n                  if dist < rad_sum:\n                      violations+=1; scale = (dist/rad_sum)*(1.0-SAFETY); radii[i]*=scale; radii[j]*=scale\n          if violations == 0: break\n      return centers, radii\n\n  # --- Data Loading ---\n  def load_true_sota_data():\n      centers_path = 'storage/Prometheus/true_sota_baseline/centers.txt'\n      radii_path = 'storage/Prometheus/true_sota_baseline/radii.txt'\n      try:\n          return np.loadtxt(centers_path), np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n      except Exception: return None, None\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      base_centers, base_radii = load_true_sota_data()\n      if base_centers is None:\n          return np.zeros((N, 2)), np.zeros(N)\n\n      # Initialize with the true SOTA score\n      best_score = np.sum(base_radii)\n\
    \      best_packing = (base_centers, base_radii)\n      print(f\"Initial SOTA baseline score: {best_score}\")\n      \n      # --- Final Exhaustive Jitter Spectrum Search ---\n      jitter_amplitudes = [1e-5, 5e-5, 1e-4, 5e-4, 1e-3, 2.5e-3, 5e-3]\n      restarts_per_amplitude = 10\n\n      bounds = [(0,1)]*N*2 + [(R_MIN, 0.5)]*N\n      constraints = [{'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary}, {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap}]\n\n      for amp in jitter_amplitudes:\n          print(f\"--- Testing Jitter Amplitude: {amp:.1e} ---\")\n          for i in range(restarts_per_amplitude):\n              np.random.seed((int(time.time()*1000) + i*1000 + int(amp*1e6)) % (2**32))\n              \n              jitter = np.random.uniform(-amp, amp, size=base_centers.shape)\n              perturbed_centers = np.clip(base_centers + jitter, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)\n              initial_z = cr_to_z(perturbed_centers, base_radii)\n              \n              res = minimize(objective, initial_z, method='SLSQP',\
    \ bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints, options={'maxiter': 1000, 'ftol': 1e-10})\n              \n              if res.success:\n                  c, r = z_to_cr(res.x)\n                  temp_c, temp_r = ensure_validity(c, r)\n                  current_score = np.sum(temp_r)\n                  if current_score > best_score:\n                      print(f\"  Run {i+1}: NEW SOTA FOUND! Score: {current_score:.18f}\")\n                      best_score = current_score\n                      best_packing = (temp_c, temp_r)\n\n      return best_packing[0], best_packing[1]\n```"
